<ac:layout-cell>
<h2>Authentication</h2>
<p><em>[Token type, how to obtain one, where it goes in the request, and how long it lasts.]</em></p>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">bash</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" https://api.example.internal/v1/health]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
<h2>Conventions</h2>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr><th>Content type</th><td><em>[application/json for requests and responses]</em></td></tr>
<tr><th>Versioning</th><td><em>[Version in the path; breaking changes get a new version; old versions supported for 12 months]</em></td></tr>
<tr><th>Pagination</th><td><em>[limit and start query parameters; response includes a next link]</em></td></tr>
<tr><th>Rate limits</th><td><em>[600 requests per minute per token; 429 with Retry-After when exceeded]</em></td></tr>
<tr><th>Timestamps</th><td><em>[ISO 8601 in UTC]</em></td></tr>
<tr><th>Idempotency</th><td><em>[PUT and DELETE are idempotent; POST accepts an Idempotency-Key header]</em></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h2>Endpoints</h2>
<h3><em>[GET /items]</em></h3>
<p><em>[What it returns and when to use it.]</em></p>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr><th>Parameter</th><th>In</th><th>Type</th><th>Required</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td><em>[status]</em></td><td>query</td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td><em>[Filter by status: active, archived]</em></td></tr>
<tr><td><em>[limit]</em></td><td>query</td><td>integer</td><td>No</td><td><em>[Page size, default 50, max 200]</em></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">bash</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="title">Request</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" "https://api.example.internal/v1/items?status=active&limit=2"]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">json</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="title">Response 200</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[{
  "results": [
    {"id": "itm_01", "name": "Example", "status": "active"}
  ],
  "next": "/v1/items?status=active&limit=2&start=2"
}]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr><th>Status</th><th>Meaning</th></tr>
<tr><td>200</td><td>Success</td></tr>
<tr><td>401</td><td>Missing or expired token</td></tr>
<tr><td>403</td><td>Token lacks the required scope</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3><em>[POST /items]</em></h3>
<p><em>[What it creates. Note any side effects.]</em></p>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Required</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td><em>[name]</em></td><td>string</td><td>Yes</td><td><em>[Display name, 1 to 100 characters]</em></td></tr>
<tr><td><em>[status]</em></td><td>string</td><td>No</td><td><em>[Defaults to active]</em></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">bash</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="title">Request</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[curl -X POST -H "Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN" -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"name": "Example"}' https://api.example.internal/v1/items]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">json</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name="title">Response 201</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[{"id": "itm_02", "name": "Example", "status": "active"}]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
<h2>Errors</h2>
<p>All errors use the same body.</p>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code"><ac:parameter ac:name="language">json</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[{"error": {"code": "validation_failed", "message": "name is required", "details": []}}]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr><th>Code</th><th>HTTP status</th><th>Meaning</th><th>What to do</th></tr>
<tr><td><em>[validation_failed]</em></td><td>400</td><td><em>[Request body failed validation]</em></td><td><em>[Check details for the field]</em></td></tr>
<tr><td><em>[not_found]</em></td><td>404</td><td><em>[No resource with that ID]</em></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td><em>[rate_limited]</em></td><td>429</td><td><em>[Too many requests]</em></td><td><em>[Wait for Retry-After seconds]</em></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
